      "data": {
        "identity": {"graphId": "canvas-smoke-test"},
        "markdown": "# Canvas Smoke Test\n\n## Pass\n\n- **Wave** renders a visible canvas waveform.\n- **Bars** renders visible canvas bars.\n- Resizing or zooming does not leave either panel blank.\n- No renderer exception appears.\n\n## Scope\n\nThis first smoke test exercises the native `canvas` node only. It deliberately does **not** test animation yet.\n\nOnce this passes, add a second fixture for declarative `renderShape.kind: canvas` views before using canvas as a class detail surface."
      }
    }
